Nature of the changes
---------------------

SoundNet extends BirdNET-Go from a bird-focused soundscape analyser into a
general acoustic event detector. The substantive additions are new packages
under internal/ providing a DSP diagnostics layer, an external enrichment
layer, and associated user interface; upstream files are modified only at
thin, clearly marked integration points.
